  "title": "AUTOMATIC TRANSMISSION — On-Vehicle Repair",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 1,
      "description": "Illustration showing the location and removal of solenoid No. 3, with an arrow pointing to the solenoid assembly mounted on the valve body",
      "labels": [
